[947.076028, "o", "cat docs/README.md\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[947.078195, "o", "# ForgeKit\r\n\r\nInternal build automation tool for the C package monorepo.\r\n\r\n## Packages\r\n\r\n| Name | Type | Version | Dependencies |\r\n|------|------|---------|-------------|\r\n| libbase | library | 1.0.0 | (none) |\r\n| libcrypto | library | 1.2.0 | libbase |\r\n| libnet | library | 1.1.0 | libbase |\r\n| libstore | library | 1.3.0 | libbase, libcrypto |\r\n| svc-auth | service | 2.0.1 | libcrypto, libstore |\r\n| svc-gateway | service | 2.1.0 | libnet, libcrypto |\r\n| svc-worker | service | 1.5.0 | libstore, libnet |\r\n| svc-scheduler | service | 1.0.0 | libstore, libnet, libcrypto |\r\n\r\n## Usage\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n./forge build --all          # build everything in dependency order\r\n./forge build --package NAME # build a specific package and its deps\r\n./forge test --all           # run tests for all packages\r\n./forge list                 # list packages\r\n./forge deps NAME            # show dependency tree\r\n./forge report               # generate build report\r\n./forge config generate ENV  # generate deployment configs\r\n./forge art"]
[947.078318, "o", "ifact pack NAME   # package a build artifact\r\n./forge clean --all          # remove all build artifacts\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Manifest Format\r\n\r\nEach package has a `package.forge` file:\r\n\r\n```\r\n[package]\r\nname = libbase\r\nversion = 1.0.0\r\ntype = library\r\n\r\n[deps]\r\ndeps = dep1,dep2\r\n\r\n[build]\r\ncommand = make\r\ntest_command = make test\r\noutput = build/libbase.a\r\n\r\n[meta]\r\ndescription = Package description\r\ntags = tag1,tag2\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Test Suite\r\n\r\nRun the internal test suite:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nbash tests/run_tests.sh\r\n```\r\n"]
[947.07868, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[947.078761, "o", "root@n30009:/app# "]
[1105.204654, "i", "for f in packages/*/package.forge; do echo \"===== $f =====\"; grep -E '^(name|version|type|deps) =' \"$f\"; done\n"]
